"description":"Take complete control of your vehicle finances with My Car! The all-in-one solution for tracking fuel consumption, maintenance costs, and overall vehicle performance with incredible ease.\n\nSAVE MONEY AND TIME WITH MY CAR:\n• Instantly track and analyze fuel efficiency to reduce consumption costs\n• Maintain detailed records of all vehicle expenses in one secure place\n• Never miss important maintenance with comprehensive service history\n• Make smarter decisions with visual statistics and detailed charts\n\nFREE FEATURES:\n• Powerful fuel mileage tracker supporting all fuel types (gas, diesel, electric, hybrid)\n• Complete expense tracking for services, repairs, and all vehicle-related costs\n• Built-in photo gallery to document your vehicles and maintenance\n• Digital receipt storage - attach photos and documents to any recorded event\n• Location memory for fuel stations and service centers for easier data entry\n• Comprehensive event history with advanced search and filtering options\n• Insightful statistics and charts: fuel efficiency trends, price fluctuations, cost breakdowns, monthly expenses, and much more\n• Support for multiple vehicles (manage up to 3 vehicles with the free version)\n• Flexible measurement units: liters/gallons/kWh, km/miles, mpg/L/100km\n• Full support for bi-fuel vehicles (e.g., gasoline/CNG)\n• Easy data import from Fuelio, Fuelly, Drivvo and other similar apps\n• Secure data export and backup options\n• Modern, intuitive interface designed for simplicity and efficiency\n\nPREMIUM FEATURES:\n• Secure cloud storage with automatic synchronization across all your devices\n• Access your vehicle data anytime from mobile or desktop via our web app\n• Generate professional PDF reports for expenses, maintenance, and efficiency\n• Expanded vehicle management (up to 6 vehicles or 100 with Premium Business)\n• Multi-driver support with customizable access permissions\n• Income tracking for business uses (rentals, ride-sharing, deliveries)\n• Customizable service reminders to stay on top of maintenance schedules\n• Trip log\n• Ad-free experience for uninterrupted usage\n• Additional premium features regularly added\n\nPerfect for individual car owners, motorcycle enthusiasts, and small business fleet managers who want complete visibility and control over their vehicle expenses.\n\nDownload My Car today and start making smarter decisions about your vehicle expenses!\n\nTerms and conditions: https://mycar-app.com/my-car-terms", "averageUserRating":4.70629000000000008441247700829990208148956298828125, "trackCensoredName":"My Car - Vehicle Manager", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/my-car-vehicle-manager/id1165749302?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "minimumOsVersion":"15.0", "bundleId":"com.kineapps.mycar", "genres":["Finance", "Utilities"], "genreIds":["6015", "6002"], "primaryGenreName":"Finance", "primaryGenreId":6015, "price":0.00, "artistId":1165749301, "artistName":"KineApps Oy", "userRatingCount":1127}]
